Brand icons

The web client shows the icon of each agent and model service it can use, from the files in
apps/web/src/assets/brands/. They are copied unmodified from the sources below. The marks are trademarks of their
respective owners and are used only to identify the service or tool; their use does not imply endorsement.

From the project's own repository or site:

- pi: pi.svg, https://pi.dev/logo-auto.svg (the logo linked from the README of github.com/earendil-works/pi,
  MIT), retrieved 2026-10-25.
- OpenCode: opencode-light.svg and opencode-dark.svg, github.com/anomalyco/opencode (MIT) at commit
  6806c6e29a7d2087335794d8b86c6031cdb5f6dd, packages/console/app/src/asset/brand/opencode-logo-light-square.svg and
  opencode-logo-dark-square.svg.
- DeepSeek Harness: deepseek-harness.svg, github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness (MIT) at commit
  22ddee3792402c3e70ec5f86a63c3e3e895a2f60, apps/web/public/favicon.svg. DeepSeek Harness is a registered trademark
  of DeepSeek.
- Gemini CLI: gemini-cli.png, github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli (Apache-2.0) at commit
  cd1b45c2db0a5ea7b7fc3b67c1ba5879601d6005, packages/vscode-ide-companion/assets/icon.png.
- Qwen Code: qwen-code.svg, github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code (Apache-2.0) at commit
  e4eb0183ff56becfc6913ccb67cad8587e8ba6b0, packages/desktop/bootstrap/qwen-code-logo.svg.
- goose: goose.png, github.com/aaif-goose/goose (Apache-2.0) at commit 0276d567aa00d426161c51e9c0f52baabe5958ea,
  documentation/static/img/logo_light.png.
- Ollama: ollama.svg, github.com/ollama/ollama (MIT) at commit 675150d6ad2747df1e218ef59de9194bc4a7e538,
  docs/favicon.svg.

